  "slug": "mint-chutney",
  "name": "Mint Chutney",
  "recipe_type": "appetizer",
  "brief_description": "A perfect mint chutney recipe. Cilantro, mint, and a hint of spice make this a magnificent sauce that goes well with lamb or Indian dishes.",
  "cuisine": "Indian",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Combine onion, cilantro, mint, chile pepper, tamarind juice, and salt in a food processor. Process to a fine paste, adding enough water to achieve a thick sauce."
    }
  ],
